      "blocks": {
        "heading_UxC94y": {
          "type": "heading",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "title": "Easy Controls, Effortless Adjustments for the Perfect Ergonomic Chair",
            "use_h1": false
          }
        },
        "text_cGMzEL": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<h3>Easy Controls, Effortless Adjustments for the Perfect Ergonomic Chair</h3><p>Simply reach down and use the handle to adjust the recline angle and seat height. The intuitive controls make fine-tuning effortless, ensuring this is the perfect ergonomic chair for a variety of settings. With parts covered for three years and a straightforward return policy through Sihoo Australia, the Sihoo M57 is a reliable investment that keeps you cool and comfortable while you work.</p>",
            "enlarge_text": false
          }
        }
